  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3MDGFund med fokus p&#xe5; m&#xf6;drah&#xe4;lsa och barnh&#xe4;lsa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3MDGFund with focus on maternal and child health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Three Millennium Development Goal Fund (3MDG) was established in 2012 by a consortium of&#xa0;international donors to address basic health needs of vulnerable people in Myanmar, and&#xa0;contribute to the country&#x2019;s efforts to achieve the three health-related Millennium Development Goals. These&#xa0;three goals consist of reducing child mortality, improving maternal health and combating HIV, tuberculosis&#xa0;and malaria. 3MDG places special emphasis upon provision of quality maternal, newborn and child health&#xa0;services.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r ett st&#xf6;d till en givargemensam FN-fond(UNOPS/3MDG)med     fokus p&#xe5; m&#xf6;drah&#xe4;lsa(MDG5)och barnh&#xe4;lsa(MDG4)i Burma/Myanmar. Genom    st&#xe4;rkande av det nationella h&#xe4;lsosystemet samt samordning av akt&#xf6;rer  fr&#xe5;n det civila samh&#xe4;llet, FN-organen och h&#xe4;lsoministeriet med fokus  p&#xe5; s&#xe4;rskilt utsatta omr&#xe5;den skall insatsen bidra till att minska      m&#xf6;drad&#xf6;dligheten och barnad&#xf6;dligheten i Burma/Myanmar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a support to a donorcoordinated UN-fund           (UNOPS/3MDG) with focus on maternal health (MDG5) and child health    (MDG4)in Burma/Myanmar. Strengthening the national health system and  coordination of actors from civil society, the UN-system and the      ministry of health with focus on hard-to-reach areas will contribute  to decrease maternal mortality and child mortality in Burma/Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
